what REDS %646's booked sweep, counted rather than sampled. The 5-in-40 sample named two instances; the class is now enumerated. The submodule half is already swept -- 40 of 43 gratitude/tigerbeetle dependents skip honestly, and the three that do not are a say-line, a correct presence report, and a witness retired from the living suite by name in 20260711. The live half is the build-artifact one: nine witnesses hard-assert test -x brushstroke/bin/brushstroke-wayland-seed, a gitignored build output absent from every fresh clone, and all nine are unrostered -- %646's shape exactly. Sweep them to the worked example's honest-skip idiom so each becomes rostable, and build a scan that reads the class by structure and gates it at zero.
